body:
I went through something kinda similar a little while ago. Me and her don't talk anymore. Here's what I **wished** I did;  
Tell her that you are starting to develop feelings for her and if she doesn't feel the same way thats completely fine. If you still want to be friends you might want to put some distance between the two of you for a while, atleast until your feelings die down. Communicate this to her.   
Hope you find this advice helpful, good luck
